  "releaseNotes": "Improved linear algebra contract validation and consistency across matrix operations, decompositions, and specialized element types. Provider compatibility metadata is now available. Compatible v10 MKL providers remain supported; modern packages provide explicit validation. Set AllowLegacyProviders to false to require modern metadata.",
